WEBVTT

00:02:29.303 --> 00:02:32.240
They wear bright colors, rose and blue,

00:02:32.264 --> 00:02:33.854
like Eastern dress."

00:02:34.857 --> 00:02:38.434
Sometimes, she said,
before the people come on,

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:41.976
she may hallucinate
pink and blue squares on the floor,

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.888
which seem to go up to the ceiling.

00:02:44.856 --> 00:02:49.454
I said, "Is this like a dream?"

00:02:49.478 --> 00:02:52.837
And she said, "No, it's not
like a dream. It's like a movie."

00:02:52.861 --> 00:02:55.500
She said, "It's got color.
It's got motion.

00:02:55.524 --> 00:02:58.976
But it's completely silent,
like a silent movie."

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.254
And she said it's a rather boring movie.